olve_to: bounded least squares inside the joint ranges) from the previous state, cart and\n   jaws at the stored values; a failed solve retries from the source state; joint labels nearest the previous state;\n - each approach starts from the re-targeted play state nearest (in the source) to its first state;\n - every kept state gets r17chain's planning check (Checker.check full: 10 mm robot-environment, 5 mm gripper /\n   held-environment, self, ranges). Accepted per state: TCP within POSE_MM (0.5 mm) / 0.2 deg of the source, joint\n   step <= 10 deg, no hits. A pass is an ordinary chain json and must still pass the <= 4 mm re-check\n   (r19mount_check.py).\nKIND=prep (r19prepchain.py sets): r19fr5prep_retarget.py executed unchanged from its source (it is already general:\nthe source TCP from a model built with the source arm), only its output written to results/r19/mount/.\npython r19mount_retarget.py SRC=<chain json> ARM=<target> [KIND=chain|prep] <r17chain options> [RACK=keyed SPX= SPY=]\n       [WINDOW=1] [NSTART=6] [TAG=rt]   -> results/r19/mount/chain_<act>_s<sign>_<TAG>_<arm>.json (prep: chain_<act>_<TAG>_<arm>.json)", "source": "results/r17/chain_lever_s+1_final_fr5_j6_pgc_sp20.json", "source_arm": "fr5_j6_pgc_sp20", "layer": {"rack": "keyed", "spider": [1.56, 0.2]}, "window": false, "argv": ["ACT=lever", "SIGN=1", "SPX=1.56", "SPY=.20", "PY=.15"], "tcp_change_in_tool_frame": {"dp_mm": [76.24, 0.0, 9.6], "rot_deg": 0.0}, "start": "source state", "start_screen": [{"start": "source state", "bad_states": 16, "first_bad": 0, "max_step_deg": 2.65}, {"start": "solver start 0 (12.8 mm)", "bad_states": 16, "first_bad": 0, "max_step_deg": 3.28}, {"start": "solver start 1 (12.8 mm)", "bad_states": 16, "first_bad": 0, "max_step_deg": 3.28}, {"start": "solver start 2 (12.8 mm)", "bad_states": 16, "first_bad": 0, "max_step_deg": 3.28}, {"start": "solver start 3 (12.8 mm)", "bad_states": 16, "first_bad": 0, "max_step_deg": 3.28}, {"start": "solver start 4 (12.8 mm)", "bad